    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that’s just what people say to feel better. it doesn't change the math. i look at my family tree and i don't see people, i see a pattern. a loop. it feels less like a \"condition to manage\" and more like a biological expiration date. how am i supposed to believe i'm different when the very blueprint of my body is designed to fail the same way they did?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
