      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"power to shape destiny\" stuff feels like such a lie. it's just a way to ignore the reality of what's actually happening. if the script is already written, isn't fighting it just... unnecessary struggle? like, why keep dragging out a tragedy that everyone already knows the ending to?",
