      "content": "I understand that it might feel like \"messaging\" when you view the situation through a lens of inevitability. The phrase \"power to shape destiny\" might indeed feel dismissive or wishful thinking if it seems at odds with your lived experience. Rather than hiding behind metaphors, the focus could be on seeking out the practical ways that can provide you with immediate relief and long-term coping strategies, regardless of your view on the \"great plan.\" Engaging with healthcare professionals can help identify interventions and support systems that make a real difference. It's not about denying the difficult aspects of your situation, but rather embracing your strength, exploring all available avenues, and finding ways to live fully in spite of, rather than because of, your circumstances. Even if the ultimate outcome seems certain, the journey mattered—looking after yourself, in whatever form that takes, can be the most powerful act you can undertake.",
